    "media:imagetext": "TIMETABLE SUPPLEMENT Effective June I5-June 30, 1952\nTRANS\nWORLD\nAIRLINES\nTWA\nU.S.A. • EUROPE • AFRICA • ASIA\nTRANS WORLD\nAIRLINES\nNOTICE: To satisfy the unusual demand for TWA services,\nTWA will be adding new flights at 15-day intervals during\nthe summer months. After the effective period of this special\ntimetable supplement, please call your local travel agent or\nyour nearest TWA office for latest flight information, or ask\nfor a copy of the latest revised timetable supplement.\nConsult any TWA agent or representative for current rates\nand general information. We regret that we are unable to\npublish all TWA flight information in a single folder during\nthis time of rapidly increasing schedules.",
